      "raw": "<p>Sooo I just did some math, and there could be a SCRPG Live Issue 6 at PAX Unplugged if &gt;G pushes themselves a little:</p>\r\n<p>Season 2 Issue 2: September 19<br />\r\n\tSeason 2 Issue 3: September 26<br />\r\n\tSeason 2 Issue 4: October 3<br />\r\n\tSeason 2 Issue 5: October 10<br />\r\n\tSeason 2 Issue 6: October 17<br />\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Season 3 Character Creation: Week of Oct. 22<br />\r\n\tSeason 3 Issue 1: Week of October 29<br />\r\n\tSeason 3 Issue 2: Week of November 5<br />\r\n\tSeason 3 Issue 3: Week of November 12<br />\r\n\tSeason 3 Issue 4: Week of November 19<br />\r\n\tSeason 3 Issue 5: Week of November 26</p>\r\n<p><br />\r\n\tSeason 3 Issue 6: Weekend of November 30 -December 2</p>\r\n<p>Having missed the Live issue at Gen Con, I'd be very interested if they decide to do one at Unplugged, but I'm expecting them to take some time between seasons 2 and 3, so I guess we'll see!</p>",
